<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unimarc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unimarc started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers started coverage of Chile's Supermercados Unimarc SA Wednesday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The rating is &quot;based upon strong earnings projections and the company's current trading discount to its Chilean peer group,&quot; Salomon said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off 1/16 to 18-5/16 in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
